# Do not try to merge files when they have conflicts, but rather use our
# side of the merge over others.
* merge=ours

# treat these files as binaries
*.meta -text -diff

# .object files are pretty-printed JSON (see .githooks/pre-commit);
# allow diff'ing but still skip line-ending normalisation since the
# hook already writes LF consistently.
*.object -text
